DESCRIPTION:A gentle and magical tale by Studio Ghibli that celebrates the innocence of childhood\, the quiet beauty of nature\, and the meaning of home found in family. Through the eyes of two sisters who move to the countryside\, the story unfolds into a world of forest spirits and unseen friends.
